  ;; Motorola 68000 (kind 21). Register file: D0..D7 as i32 at offset 64 + 4n,
  ;; A0..A7 at 96 + 4n (A7 = SP), SR at 20 (X 16, N 8, Z 4, V 2, C 1), PC at
